        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Katharine Hepburn, Paul Henreid, Robert Walker, Leo G. Carroll, Clarence Brown\n- Companies: Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer\n- Works: Song of Love (1947 film)\n- Topics: Academy Awards, film genres\n\nFacts:\n- Song of Love is a 1947 biographical film starring Katharine Hepburn, Paul Henreid, Robert Walker, and Leo G. Carroll.\n- Clarence Brown directed Song of Love, and Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer released the film.\n- Katharine Hepburn appeared in genres ranging from screwball comedy to literary drama.\n- Katharine Hepburn won four Academy Awards for Best Actress, which is a record for any performer.",
